{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["Which you shall proclaim as holy convocations — which you shall designate as holy occasions. Every instance of the language of קריאה in connection with appointed times is the language of fixing a time, as in: ״קרא עלי מועד״. And so the Targum: מערעי קדיש. And the language of כמקרה הכסיל."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:15.915137570Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}